Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?x1600:=20restore=20the=20abs-axis=20metadata=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?(exonerated=20by=20the=20v0.91=20bisect)=20=E2=80=94=20QMP=20ab?=
 =?UTF-8?q?s=20mapping=20predictable?=
